cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Referendum Design Simulator (refsim)"
version: "1.1.5"
date-released: "2026-10-24"
license: MIT
authors:
  - family-names: "Prifti"
    given-names: "Endri"
abstract: >-
  The reusable tool of the book Engineering Albania's Referendum Law: A Design Guide.
  For any validity rule, referendum type, calendar and signature-verification rule it computes
  campaign equilibria and the book's four evaluation criteria, and it reproduces every simulated
  result of the book from the scenario files in config/.
keywords:
  - referendum
  - quorum
  - electoral register
  - Albania
  - simulation
  - game theory
